on" "q-317033" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We require a $2\\times 2$ matrix $T$ such that\n    \n\n$$\nT\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}(-6)\\cdot x+4\\cdot y \\\\ 5\\cdot x+(-3)\\cdot y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that\n    \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-6 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-6x+4y \\\\ 5x-3y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n    Therefore, the matrix which represents the linear transformation $T$ is\n    \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-6 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14048912/state.json" "file_sha256" "5578abe544083bb020bc567f821bf5cccd4f5d4cd97fa48ccd6abe528b5372e8"} {"question" "q-317033" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14048912/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6134ddf7b57f55c89c7bc4c99506f1638d1997b56cb703b1c37522a0a9d9acea"} {"question" "q-317033" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14048912/state.json" "file_sha256" "5578abe544083bb020bc567f821bf5cccd4f5d4cd97fa48ccd6abe528b5372e8"} {"question" "q-317033" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14048912/state.json" "file_sha256" "5578abe544083bb020bc567f821bf5cccd4f5d4cd97fa48ccd6abe528b5372e8"} {"question" "q-317033" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Co